 Solution: def find_length(string):
    count_map = {0: -1}
    max_len = 0
    current_diff = 0
    for (i, ch) in enumerate(string):
        if ch == '0':
            current_diff += 1
        else:
            current_diff -= 1
        if current_diff in count_map:
            max_len = max(max_len, i - count_map[current_diff])
        else:
            count_map[current_diff] = i
    return max_len.
 Test: def check():
    assert find_length("11000010001") == 6
    assert find_length("10111") == 1
    assert find_length("11011101100101") == 2

